      <p class="toy-caption">The “narrow I/O” names are deliberately illustrative, and the WASI profile shows representative imports rather than a complete WASI world. Dekopon has committed to broker-controlled narrow asynchronous host interfaces, but no privileged WIT contract exists on the source snapshot.</p>
